#: status_noble_phantasm_specification.dic:16
msgid "対界宝具"
msgstr "Anti-World NP"

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:8
msgid ""
"不可視の剣。\n"
"敵に武器の間合いを把握させない、\n"
"シンプルではあるが\n"
"白兵戦において絶大な効果を発揮する。\n"
"強力な魔術によって守護された宝具で、\n"
"剣自体が透明という訳ではない。\n"
"\n"
"風を纏った刀身は\n"
"光の屈折率を変化させ、\n"
"元から有る剣の形状を不可視にしている。"
msgstr ""
"An invisible sword.\n"
"It does not allow the enemy to determine its range. It is simple, but tremendously effective in hand-to-hand combat.\n"
"It is a noble phantasm protected by string magic, but it does not mean that the sword itself is invisible.\n"
"\n"
"The blade is clad in wind that changes the refraction of light and makes the shape of the sword invisible."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:17
msgid ""
"真空状態という程ではないが、\n"
"刀身に渦巻いた風は凶器そのもので、\n"
"斬撃の破壊力も増大するようだ。\n"
"\n"
"圧縮した風を解放した瞬間のみ、\n"
"真空状態を作り上げる事ができる。\n"
"\n"
"攻撃対象が\n"
"『視覚妨害による補正への耐性』\n"
"を持っている場合、\n"
"風王結界による命中補正は\n"
"効果を発揮しない。"
msgstr ""
"It is not a vacuum, but the wind whirring around the blade is like a weapon and it seems to increase the damage of the slash.\n"
"\n"
"Only when the compressed wind is released is a vacuum state created.\n"
"\n"
"When the target has “resistance to visual impediments”, the accuracy correction of Invisible Air is ineffective."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:26
msgid ""
"刀身を透明にする、\n"
"という長所の他に、圧縮した風を解放し、\n"
"一度かぎりの飛び道具として放つ事も可能。\n"
"\n"
"その場合のダメージは限定数値で、\n"
"セイバー自身の魔力や筋力は影響しない。"
msgstr ""
"Other than the advantage of making the blade invisible, it is possible to release the compressed wind, making it a single-use projectile weapon.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The damage of such an attack is constant, and Saber’s strength or magical energy does not affect it."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:35
msgid ""
"光の剣。\n"
"人造による武器ではなく、\n"
"星に鍛えられた神造兵装。\n"
"\n"
"聖剣というカテゴリーの中では\n"
"頂点に立つ宝具である。\n"
"\n"
"所有者の魔力を“光”に変換し、\n"
"収束・加速させる事により運動量を増大させ、\n"
"神霊レベルの魔術行使を可能とする聖剣。"
msgstr ""
"Sword of light.\n"
"\n"
"Is is not a weapon made by men, but a divine weapon forged by the planet.\n"
"\n"
"It is a Noble Phantasm that is the greatest of holy swords.\n"
"\n"
"It transforms the possessor’s magical energy into “light”, increases its kintetic energy by converging and accelerating it, and allows for usage of sorcery on the level of divine spirits."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:44
msgid ""
"第三者から見ると巨大な光の帯に見えるが、\n"
"実際は光の先端にのみ攻撃判定があり、\n"
"光によって形成された\n"
"“断層”が通過する全ての対象を切断する\n"
"“究極の斬撃”である。\n"
"\n"
"その膨大な魔力は先端以外にも熱を持たせ、\n"
"結果として地上をなぎ払う光の波に取られる。\n"
"指向性のエネルギー兵器とも言えるだろう。"
msgstr ""
"To an observer, it looks like a giant beam of light, but its target point is the tip. It is the “ultimate slash” that cuts through everything in the “area” the light goes through.\n"
"\n"
"Its enormous power heats space around the tip, and as a result it is interpreted as a wave of light that mows across the earth. You could also call it a directed energy weapon."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:53
msgid ""
"エクスカリバーの鞘の能力。\n"
"\n"
"失われた三つ目の宝具。\n"
"\n"
"聖剣の鞘はアインツベルンによって\n"
"コーンウォールにて発掘され、\n"
"時代を超えて持ち主の手に返された。\n"
"\n"
"アーサー王の伝説において、\n"
"\n"
"聖剣の真の能力は\n"
"\n"
"この鞘による“不死の力”とされている。"
msgstr ""
"The ability of Excalibur’s sheath.\n"
"The lost third Noble Phantasm.\n"
"The sheath of the holy sword was excavated by Einzbern at Cornwell, and returned to the hand of its owner through time.\n"
"\n"
"In the legend of King Arthur, the real ability of the holy sword is said to be the “Power of Immortality” in this sheath."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:62
msgid ""
"所有者の傷を癒し\n"
"老化を停滞させる能力があるが、\n"
"実際は個人を対象とした\n"
"“移動要塞”と呼べるもの。\n"
"\n"
"鞘を展開し、\n"
"自身を妖精郷に置くことで\n"
"あらゆる物理干渉をシャットアウトする。\n"
"\n"
"魔法の一つ、\n"
"\n"
"並行世界からの干渉でさえ防ぎきる。"
msgstr ""
"It has the ability to heal the wounds of its owner and stop their aging, but it can actually be called a “moving fortress” centered on an individual.\n"
"\n"
"By producing the sheath and moving oneself into the land of the fairies, it shuts out all physical interactions.\n"
"\n"
"It can even defend against one of the sorceries, interation."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:71
msgid ""
"突けば必ず相手の心臓を貫く\n"
"呪いの槍。\n"
"魔槍ゲイボルクによる必殺の一刺。\n"
"\n"
"その正体は、\n"
"槍が相手の心臓に命中したという結果の後に\n"
"槍を相手に放つという原因を導く、\n"
"因果の逆転である。"
msgstr ""
"A cursed lance that will always pierce the opponent’s heart once it is thrust.\n"
"\n"
"A surely fatal strike from the cursed lance,\n"
"Gae Bolg.\n"
"\n"
"Its true nature is the reversal of cause and effect, where the cause of the lance’s thrust comes from the effect of the lance piercing the opponent’s heart."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:80
msgid ""
"槍を放つ前に\n"
"槍は既に心臓に命中しているのだから、\n"
"結果が作りあがった後に何をしようと\n"
"防御も回避も不可能。\n"
"\n"
"ゲイボルクを回避するには\n"
"ＡＧＩ（敏捷）の高さではなく、\n"
"ゲイボルクの発動前に運命を逆転させる\n"
"能力・ＬＣＫ（幸運）の高さが重要となる。\n"
"\n"
"宝具発動に必要とする魔力量が少なく、\n"
"しかも一撃一殺という最も効率のいい宝具。"
msgstr ""
"As the lance has pierced the heart even before it is thrust, it is impossible to dodge or block it once this result has been determined.\n"
"\n"
"To dodge Gae Bolg, one does not need high AGI (agility), but instead the ability to change this fate before Gae Bolg is executed,\n"
"LCK (luck) is most important.\n"
"\n"
"It is the most efficient Noble Phantasm, as it requires little magical energy to activate, and each activation is a sure kill."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:89
msgid ""
"ゲイボルクの呪いを最大限に解放し、\n"
"渾身の力を以って投擲する\n"
"特殊使用宝具。\n"
"\n"
"もともとゲイボルクは投げ槍であり、\n"
"使用法はこちらが正しい。\n"
"\n"
"死棘の槍と違い、\n"
"こちらは心臓命中より破壊力を重視し、\n"
"一投で一部隊を吹き飛ばす。\n"
"その様は炸裂弾そのものだ。"
msgstr ""
"Fully unleashing the curse of Gae Bolg and throwing it with full force, this is a special use of the Noble Phantasm.\n"
"\n"
"Gae Bolg was originally a thrown lance, and this was actually the correct usage.\n"
"\n"
"Unlike the Lance of Death Thorns, this emphasizes attack power over aiming for the heart, and it blows away an entire unit with a single throw. It is rather like an exploding bullet."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:98
msgid ""
"ダメージ、形状、\n"
"共にケルトの光神ルーの持つ\n"
"\n"
"“轟く五星（ブリューナグ）”\n"
"\n"
"に迫るが、\n"
"\n"
"「幾たび躱されようと相手を貫く」\n"
"\n"
"という能力から北欧の主神オーディンの\n"
"\n"
"“大神宣言（グングニル）”\n"
"\n"
"よりの宝具と言えよう。"
msgstr ""
"The damage and form both come close to that of\n"
"“Brionac, the Roaring Five Stars”\n"
"\n"
"possessed by Lugh, the Celtic God of Light, but its ability of “striking an opponent no matter how many times it is dodged”\n"
"\n"
"makes is closer to the chief god of Northern Europe, Odin’s\n"
"\n"
"“Gungnir, Declaration of Great God”."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:105
msgid "アンリミテッドブレイドワークス"
msgstr "Unlimited Blade Works"

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:106
msgid "無限の剣製"
msgstr "Infinite Sword Creation"

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:107
msgid ""
"アーチャーが可能とする、\n"
"固有結界と呼ばれる特殊魔術。\n"
"\n"
"視認した武器を複製する。\n"
"ただし、\n"
"複製した武器はランクが一つ下がる。\n"
"\n"
"防具も可能だが、\n"
"その場合は通常投影の二倍～三倍の\n"
"魔力を必要とする。"
msgstr ""
"A special magic called a Reality Marble, which Archer is able to use.\n"
"\n"
"Can duplicate any weapon he has seen, but the duplicated weapon has its rank reduced by one.\n"
"\n"
"Defensive equipment is also possible, but it requires two to three times as much magical energy."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:116
msgid ""
"使用時は全ての能力値が1ランクアップ。\n"
"ＡＣも＋１００される。\n"
"神代の獣を使役し、\n"
"その超突進を以って対象を粉砕する物理攻撃。\n"
"ＭＡＸスピードは\n"
"時速４００キロとも５００キロとも言われている。\n"
"使用中は天馬の加護により、\n"
"防御力も上昇するという攻守ともに最高レベルの宝具。\n"
"\n"
"また、ベルレフォーンは\n"
"ギリシャ神話においてペガサスを\n"
"乗りこなしたとされる青年の名前である。"
msgstr ""
"All abilities increase by a rank when in use.\n"
"AC+100 will also be in effect.\n"
"\n"
"It is a physical attack that destroys the target by controlling a divine beast and using its powerful charge. Supposedly, the maximum speed is 400 or 500 kmph.\n"
"\n"
"It is a noble phantasm of the highest level in both attack and defense, as defense also increases while in use due to Pegasus’s divine protection.\n"
"\n"
"Bellerophon is the name of the young man in Greek mythology who supposedly managed to ride Pegasus."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:125
msgid ""
"血の結界。\n"
"\n"
"内部に取り込んだ人間を溶解する。\n"
"溶解された人間は赤い血液となり、\n"
"結界使用者に吸収される。\n"
"\n"
"本来の用途は魔力吸収である。"
msgstr ""
"A barrier of blood.\n"
"\n"
"It melts the people within it. The melted people become red blood, and are absorbed by the user of the barrier.\n"
"\n"
"Its primary use is to absorb magical energy."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:134
msgid ""
"自身にかける魔眼殺し。\n"
"\n"
"封印解除で魔眼・キュベレイを常時使用。"
msgstr ""
"A “mystic eye killer”, targeted on oneself.\n"
"\n"
"When the seal is released, the mystic eye Cybele can be used continuously."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:141
msgid "ルールブレイカー"
msgstr "Quebranta reglas"

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:142
msgid "破戒すべき全ての符"
msgstr "Destructor de todos los signos"

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:143
msgid ""
"あらゆる魔術を破戒する短刀。\n"
"\n"
"魔力で強化された物体、\n"
"契約によって繋がった関係、\n"
"魔力によって生み出された生命を\n"
"“作られる前”\n"
"の状態に戻す究極の対魔術宝具。\n"
"\n"
"裏切りの魔女の神性を\n"
"具現化させさせた魔術兵装。\n"
"\n"
"その外見通り攻撃力は微弱で、\n"
"ナイフ程度の殺傷力しか持たない。"
msgstr ""
"A dagger that can destroy any magic.\n"
"\n"
"An ultimate anti-magic Noble Phantasm that returns any object strengthened with magic, bound by contract, or any life form created out of magic, to a state prior to its “creation”.\n"
"\n"
"A magical weapon that materializes the divinity of the witch of betrayal.\n"
"\n"
"Like its appearance, its attack power is weak and it has only the killing power of a knife."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:151
msgid ""
"神の祝福（呪い）\n"
"によって得た不死性。\n"
"\n"
"肉体を屈強な鎧と化す。\n"
"ランク・B以下の攻撃を全て無効化。"
msgstr ""
"Immortality gained from the blessing (curse) of the gods.\n"
"\n"
"The body becomes strong armor. Nullifies any attack rank B or below."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:160 status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:169
msgid ""
"隠された能力。\n"
"\n"
"死亡しても\n"
"自動的に蘇生（レイズ）がかかる。\n"
"蘇生のストック数は十一回。\n"
"\n"
"つまり、バーサーカーは\n"
"十二回倒されなければ消滅しない。"
msgstr ""
"A hidden ability.\n"
"\n"
"Regenerates automatically, even when killed.\n"
"There is a stock of eleven regenerations.\n"
"\n"
"In other words, Berserker needs to be defeated twelve times to be eliminated."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:178
msgid ""
"黄金の都へ繋がる鍵剣。\n"
"\n"
"空間を繋げ、\n"
"宝物庫の中にある道具を\n"
"自由に取り出せるようになる。\n"
"\n"
"使用者の財があればあるほど\n"
"強力な宝具となるのは言うまでもない。"
msgstr ""
"A sword that leads to the golden capital.\n"
"\n"
"It connects space, and allows the user to freely take any tool from the treasure room.\n"
"\n"
"Needless to say, this Noble Phantasm will become stronger the more wealth a person has."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:187
msgid ""
"乖離剣・エアによる空間切断。\n"
"圧縮され鬩ぎ合う風圧の断層は、\n"
"擬似的な時空断層となって\n"
"敵対する全てを粉砕する。\n"
"\n"
"対粛正ＡＣか、\n"
"同レベルのダメージによる相殺でなければ\n"
"防げない攻撃数値。\n"
"ＳＴＲ×２０ダメージだが、\n"
"ランダムでＭＧＩの数値もＳＴＲに＋される。"
msgstr ""
"Cutting of space by the Sword of Separation, Ea.\n"
"\n"
"A layer of wind, compressed and accelerated becomes a fake layer of time and space that smashes all who oppose it.\n"
"\n"
"Its attack power is so strong that an elimination rank AC or a counterattack with an equivalent damage level is needed to defend against this Noble Phantasm.\n"
"\n"
"Damage is STRx20, though MGI may be added to STR at random."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:198
msgid ""
"最大ダメージ４０００。\n"
"\n"
"が、宝物庫にある宝具のバックアップによっては\n"
"さらにダメージ数は跳ね上がる。\n"
"\n"
"セイバーのエクスカリバーと同等か、\n"
"それ以上の出力を持つ\n"
"“世界を切り裂いた”\n"
"剣である。"
msgstr ""
"Its maximum damage is 4000.\n"
"\n"
"But, with the support of the Noble Phantasms in his treasury, the damage increases even further.\n"
"\n"
"It has equal or superior output to Saber’s Excalibur, and it is a sword that “cut apart the world”."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:207 status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:216
msgid "ザバーニーヤ"
msgstr "Zabaniya"

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:208 status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:217
msgid "妄想心音"
msgstr "Heartbeat of Delusion"

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:209
msgid ""
"呪いの腕。\n"
"悪性の精霊・シャイターンの腕であり、\n"
"人間を呪い殺す事に長けている。\n"
"\n"
"エーテル塊を用いて、\n"
"鏡に映した殺害対象の反鏡存在から\n"
"本物と影響しあう二重存在を作成する。\n"
"殺害対象と共鳴したその偽者を潰す事で、\n"
"本物には指一本触れずに\n"
"殺害対象を呪い殺す。"
msgstr ""
"The arm of curses. This is the arm of the evil spirit Shaytaan, and it has the power to curse people to death.\n"
"\n"
"Using a cluster of ether, it creates a dual existence from the reflected figure of the target in a mirror that influences the real target.\n"
"By killing the fake that affects the real, it curses the target to death without putting a finger on the target."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:218
msgid ""
"強力な物理防御を無効にし、\n"
"心臓を潰す暗殺術。\n"
"どれほど堅固な鎧をつけていようと、\n"
"妄想心音の前では意味をなさない。\n"
"\n"
"妄想心音に対抗するには\n"
"ＣＯＮ（耐久）の高さではなく、\n"
"二重存在を作成させない能力\n"
"ＭＧＩ（魔力）の高さが重要となる。"
msgstr ""
"An assassination technique that ignores any strong physical defenses and destroys the heart. No matter how strong the target’s armor, it is meaningless against the Heartbeat of Delusion.\n"
"\n"
"To resist the Heartbeat of Delusion, rather than relying on CON (constitution), it is essential to have enough MGI (magical energy) to prevent him from creating the dual existence."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:227
msgid ""
"黒い極光の剣。\n"
"エクスカリバーは\n"
"所有者の魔力を変換する増幅器である為、\n"
"黒化したセイバーの聖剣の光も、\n"
"同じように黒色となっている。\n"
"\n"
"湖の妖精に\n"
"ヴィヴィアンとモリガンが並存するように、\n"
"この聖剣も善悪両方の属性を持つようだ。"
msgstr ""
"Black sword of ultimate light.\n"
"\n"
"Since Excalibur is an amplifier that transforms the magical energy of its possessor, the light of the holy sword of Black Saber has also turned black.\n"
"\n"
"As the ladies of the lake Vivian and Morgana coexist, this holy sword seems to have attributes of both good and evil."

#: status_noble_phantasm_text.dic:236
msgid ""
"第三者から見ると\n"
"巨大な光の帯に見えるが、\n"
"実際は光の先端にのみ攻撃判定があり、\n"
"光によって形成された“断層”が通過する\n"
"全ての対象を切断する\n"
"“究極の斬撃”である。\n"
"\n"
"その膨大な魔力は先端以外にも熱を持たせ、\n"
"結果として地上をなぎ払う光の波に取られる。\n"
"\n"
"指向性のエネルギー兵器とも言えるだろう。"
msgstr ""
"To an observer, it looks like a giant beam of light, but its target point is the tip. It is the “ultimate slash” that cuts through everything in the “area” the light goes through.\n"
"\n"
"Its enormous power heats space around the tip, and as a result it is interpreted as a wave of light that mows across the earth. You could also call it a directed energy weapon."

#: status_skills.dic:4 status_skills.dic:13 status_skills.dic:24 status_skills.dic:33 status_skills.dic:42 status_skills.dic:51 status_skills.dic:60 status_skills.dic:71 status_skills.dic:80
#: status_skills.dic:89 status_skills.dic:98 status_skills.dic:107 status_skills.dic:116 status_skills.dic:125 status_skills.dic:134 status_skills.dic:143 status_skills.dic:154 status_skills.dic:171
#: status_skills.dic:180 status_skills.dic:189 status_skills.dic:200 status_skills.dic:209 status_skills.dic:218 status_skills.dic:227 status_skills.dic:236 status_skills.dic:245
#: status_skills.dic:254 status_skills.dic:263 status_skills.dic:272 status_skills.dic:283 status_skills.dic:292 status_skills.dic:301 status_skills.dic:310
#, javascript-format
msgid "%s：%s|%s"
msgstr "%s: %s|%s"

#: status_skills.dic:6 status_skills.dic:294
msgid "直感"
msgstr "Instinto"

#: status_skills.dic:8
msgid ""
"戦闘時、\n"
"つねに自身にとって最適な展開を\n"
"“感じ取る”能力。\n"
"\n"
"研ぎ澄まされた第六感は\n"
"もはや未来予知に近い。\n"
"視覚・聴覚に干渉する妨害を半減させる。"
msgstr ""
"Habilidad para “sentir” el desarollo más óptimo puro durante un combate.\n"
"\n"
"Este sexto sentido mejorado es ahora cercano a la precognición.\n"
"\n"
"Reduce a la mitad cualquier obstrucción del sentido de la vista y oído."

#: status_skills.dic:15 status_skills.dic:303
msgid "魔力放出"
msgstr "Expulsión de energía mágica"

#: status_skills.dic:17
msgid ""
"武器、ないし自身の肉体に魔力を帯びさせ、\n"
"瞬間的に放出する事によって能力を向上させる。\n"
"言ってしまえば、魔力によるジェット噴射。\n"
"\n"
"セイバーは剣戟はもとより、\n"
"防御や移動にも魔力を働かせている。\n"
"少女の身でバーサーカーと打ち合えるのは\n"
"彼女の膨大な魔力故なのである。\n"
"\n"
"強力な加護のない通常の武器では\n"
"魔力の篭もった彼女の攻撃に耐えられず、\n"
"一撃の下に破壊されるだろう。"
msgstr ""
"La energía mágica es transferida al cuerpo y arma que uno lleve, además que tras liberar la energía mágica las habilidades de uno mejoraran. Para ponerlo en perspectiva, es como una expulsión de "
"magia.\n"
"La defensa y movimiento de Saber usan esta energía mágica.\n"
"A pesar de ser una chica, ella puede luchar contra Berserker debido a su gran cantidad de magia que posee."

#: status_skills.dic:26 status_skills.dic:247 status_skills.dic:312
msgid "カリスマ"
msgstr "Carisma"

#: status_skills.dic:28
msgid ""
"軍団を指揮する天性の才能。\n"
"団体戦闘において、自軍の能力を向上させる。\n"
"\n"
"カリスマは稀有な才能で、\n"
"一国の王としてはＢランクで十分と言える。"
msgstr ""
"Natural talent to command an army.\n"
"\n"
"It increases the ability of one’s army during mass combat.\n"
"\n"
"Charisma is a rare talent, and a B rank is enough to lead a country."

#: status_skills.dic:35 status_skills.dic:202
msgid "戦闘続行"
msgstr "Battle Continuation"

#: status_skills.dic:37
msgid ""
"往生際が悪い。\n"
"\n"
"瀕死の傷でも戦闘を可能とし、\n"
"決定的な致命傷を受けない限り生き延びる。"
msgstr ""
"Does not give up easily.\n"
"\n"
"It allows for battle even on the verge of death, and allows the user to stay alive until they receive a clearly fatal blow."

#: status_skills.dic:44
msgid "仕切り直し"
msgstr "Restart"

#: status_skills.dic:46
msgid ""
"戦闘から離脱する能力。\n"
"\n"
"また、不利になった戦闘を戦闘開始ターン\n"
"（１ターン目）に戻し、\n"
"技の条件を初期値に戻す。"
msgstr ""
"The ability to escape battle.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"It can also return an unfavorable battle to the beginning (turn 1), and restore the conditions and techniques to their initial states."

#: status_skills.dic:53
msgid "ルーン"
msgstr "Rune"

#: status_skills.dic:55
msgid "北欧の魔術刻印・ルーンの所持。"
msgstr "The possession of the Northern European Magic Crest, Rune."

#: status_skills.dic:62
msgid "矢よけの加護"
msgstr "Protection against arrows"

#: status_skills.dic:64
msgid ""
"飛び道具に対する防御。\n"
"狙撃手を視界に納めている限り、\n"
"どのような投擲武装だろうと\n"
"肉眼で捉え、対処できる。\n"
"\n"
"ただし超遠距離からの直接攻撃は該当せず、\n"
"広範囲の全体攻撃にも該当しない。"
msgstr ""
"Defense against projectile weapons. As long as one keeps the shooter in its vision, one can perceive and defend against any projectile weapon.\n"
"\n"
"However, it cannot be used against a direct attack from a distance, and it also cannot be used against a wide-range attack that hits many."

#: status_skills.dic:73 status_skills.dic:136 status_skills.dic:229 status_skills.dic:256
msgid "神性"
msgstr "Divinity"

#: status_skills.dic:75
msgid ""
"神霊適性を持つかどうか。\n"
"\n"
"高いほどより物質的な神霊との混血とされる。"
msgstr ""
"Strength of one’s god-like nature.\n"
"The more godlike blood possessed, the higher this stat becomes."

#: status_skills.dic:82
msgid "千里眼"
msgstr "Clairvoyance"

#: status_skills.dic:84
msgid ""
"視力の良さ。\n"
"\n"
"遠方の標的の捕捉、\n"
"動体視力の向上。\n"
"\n"
"さらに高いランクでは、\n"
"透視・未来視さえ可能とする。"
msgstr ""
"Vision.\n"
"\n"
"Allows clear vision of distant targets, and improves body movement and vision.\n"
"\n"
"At higher ranks, it allows the Servant to see through objects, and even through time."

#: status_skills.dic:91
msgid "魔術"
msgstr "Magic"

#: status_skills.dic:93
msgid ""
"オーソドックスな魔術を習得。\n"
"\n"
"得意なカテゴリーは不明。"
msgstr ""
"Knowledge of orthodox magic.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The strength of his ability is unknown."

#: status_skills.dic:100
msgid "心眼（真）"
msgstr "Mind’s Eye (True)"

#: status_skills.dic:102
msgid ""
"修行・鍛錬によって培った洞察力。\n"
"\n"
"窮地において\n"
"自身の状況と敵の能力を冷静に把握し、\n"
"その場で残された活路を導き出す\n"
"“戦闘論理”。\n"
"\n"
"逆転の可能性が１％でもあるのなら、\n"
"その作戦を実行に移せるチャンスを\n"
"手繰り寄せられる。"
msgstr ""
"Insight fostered by training.\n"
"\n"
"A “combat logic” that allows for calm analysis of the situation and the enemy’s ability in spite of danger, and consideration of all possible actions in a particular situation.\n"
"\n"
"If there is even a 1% chance of a comeback, this ability greatly improves the chances of success."

#: status_skills.dic:109
msgid "魔眼"
msgstr "Mystic Eyes"

#: status_skills.dic:111
msgid ""
"最高レベルの魔眼・キュベレイを所有。\n"
"\n"
"ＭＧＩがＣ以下の者は無条件で石化。\n"
"Ｂの者でもセーブ判定次第で石化をうける。\n"
"Ａの者には石化判定はないが、\n"
"全能力をワンランク下げる“重圧”をかけられる。"
msgstr ""
"Possesses mystic eyes of the highest level, Cybele.\n"
"\n"
"Immediately petrifies anyone with MGI lower than C. Those with a B rating may be petrified if they are incautious. Those with an A rating cannot be petrified, but they are covered with a "
"‘pressure’ that decreases all their skills by one rank."

#: status_skills.dic:120
msgid ""
"マスターからの魔力供給を断っても\n"
"しばらくは自立できる能力。\n"
"\n"
"ランクＣならば、\n"
"マスターを失っても一日間現界可能。"
msgstr ""
"Ability that allows independent movement even after the magical energy supply is cut off from one’s master.\n"
"\n"
"With rank C, it is possible for a Servant to stay in this world for a day even after losing its Master."

#: status_skills.dic:127
msgid "怪力"
msgstr "Superhuman Strength"

#: status_skills.dic:129
msgid ""
"一時的に筋力を増幅させる。\n"
"魔物、魔獣のみが持つ攻撃特性。\n"
"\n"
"使用する事で筋力をワンランク向上させる。\n"
"持続時間は“怪力”のランクによる。"
msgstr ""
"Increases strength temporarily. An offensive ability that only devils and beasts possess.\n"
"\n"
" When activated, strength increases by one rank. The duration of the effect depends on the rank of “Superhuman Strength”."

#: status_skills.dic:137
msgid "Ｅ－"
msgstr "E−"

#: status_skills.dic:138
msgid ""
"神霊適性を持つが、\n"
"ほとんど退化してしまっている。\n"
"\n"
"英霊自身の魔物、\n"
"魔獣としてのランクが上がる度に\n"
"減少していく。"
msgstr ""
"She has some divinity, but it has mostly degenerated.\n"
"\n"
"Divinity decreases as the hero’s rank as a devil or demonic beast increases."

#: status_skills.dic:145
msgid "高速神言"
msgstr "High Speed Divine Language"

#: status_skills.dic:147
msgid ""
"呪文・魔術回路との接続をせずとも\n"
"魔術を発動させられる。\n"
"\n"
"大魔術であろうとも\n"
"一工程（シングルアクション）で起動させられる。\n"
"神代の言葉なので、\n"
"現代人には発音できない。"
msgstr ""
"Allows the activation of magic without connecting the Magic Circuit or incanting the spells.\n"
"\n"
"Even great magic can be activated with just a single action.\n"
"It is a language from the age of gods, so modern humans cannot pronounce it."

#: status_skills.dic:156
msgid "金羊の皮"
msgstr "Golden Fleece"

#: status_skills.dic:157
msgid "ＥＸ"
msgstr "EX"

#: status_skills.dic:158
msgid ""
"とっても高価。\n"
"\n"
"竜を召喚できるとされるが、\n"
"キャスターには幻獣召喚能力はないので\n"
"使用不能。"
msgstr ""
"Very valuable.\n"
"\n"
"It is said it can summon dragons, but since Caster does not have the ability to summon phantom beasts, it cannot be used."

#: status_skills.dic:165
msgid "燕返し"
msgstr "Tsubame Gaeshi"

#: status_skills.dic:166
msgid ""
"対人魔剣。\n"
"最大捕捉・１人。\n"
"相手を三つの円で同時に断ち切る絶技。\n"
"\n"
"多重次元屈折現象、\n"
"と呼ばれる物の一つらしい。\n"
"\n"
"ゲイボルクとは違った意味で、\n"
"回避不可能の必殺剣である。"
msgstr ""
"Anti-Personnel Demonic Sword.\n"
"\n"
"Maximum target: 1 person.\n"
"\n"
"An ultimate ability that slices the opponent with three arcs at the same time.\n"
"\n"
"It is said to be a multi-dimensional refracting phenomenon.\n"
"\n"
"It is an unaviodable attack, though in a different sense than that of Gae Bolg."

#: status_skills.dic:173 status_skills.dic:211
msgid "心眼（偽）"
msgstr "Mind’s Eye (Fake)"

#: status_skills.dic:175
msgid ""
"視覚妨害による補正への耐性。\n"
"\n"
"第六感、\n"
"虫の報せとも言われる、\n"
"天性の才能による危険予知である。"
msgstr ""
"Resistance to changes in visibility caused by visual interference.\n"
"\n"
"Also called the six sense, or prescience; an innate talent to sense danger."

#: status_skills.dic:182
msgid "透化"
msgstr "Transparency"

#: status_skills.dic:184
msgid ""
"明鏡止水。\n"
"\n"
"精神面への干渉を無効化する精神防御。\n"
"暗殺者ではないので、\n"
"アサシン能力「気配遮断」を使えないが、\n"
"武芸者の無想の域としての\n"
"気配遮断を行うことができる。"
msgstr ""
"Clear and serene.\n"
"\n"
"A barrier that nullifies mental intervention. Since he is not an assassin, he cannot use the Assassin Ability, Presence Concealment, but he can conceal his presence as a master of martial arts."

#: status_skills.dic:191
msgid "宗和の心得"
msgstr "Knowledge of Foremost Harmony"

#: status_skills.dic:193
msgid ""
"同じ相手に\n"
"同じ技を何度使用しても\n"
"命中精度が下がらない特殊な技能。\n"
"\n"
"攻撃が見切られなくなる。"
msgstr ""
"A special ability that prevents reduction of the effectiveness of an attack, no matter how many times it is used against the same opponent.\n"
"\n"
"Attacks will not be perceived by the enemy."

#: status_skills.dic:204
msgid ""
"生還能力。\n"
"\n"
"瀕死の傷でも戦闘を可能とし、\n"
"決定的な致命傷を受けない限り生き延びる。"
msgstr ""
"The ability to stay alive.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"It allows for battle even on the verge of death, and allows the user to stay alive until they receive a clearly fatal blow."

#: status_skills.dic:213
msgid "直感・第六感による危険回避。"
msgstr "Avoidance of danger by sixth sense/instinct."

#: status_skills.dic:220
msgid "勇猛"
msgstr "Bravery"

#: status_skills.dic:222
msgid ""
"威圧・混乱・幻惑\n"
"といった精神干渉を無効化する能力。\n"
"\n"
"また、\n"
"格闘ダメージを向上させる効果もある。\n"
"ただし現在はクラス能力により狂化している為、\n"
"能力を発揮できない。"
msgstr ""
"Ability to ignore any mental interference such as coercion, confusion, or illusion.\n"
"\n"
"It also has the effect of increasing damage when fighting unarmed, but since he has gone mad through his class ability, he cannot use this skill."

#: status_skills.dic:231
msgid ""
"神霊適性を持つかどうか。\n"
"高いほどより物質的な神霊との混血とされる。\n"
"\n"
"主神ゼウスの息子であり、\n"
"死後神に迎えられたヘラクレスの神霊適性は\n"
"最高クラスと言えるだろう。"
msgstr ""
"Strength of one’s god-like nature.\n"
"The more godlike blood possessed,\n"
"the higher this stat becomes.\n"
"\n"
"As the son of Zeus, the leader of the gods, and having been accepted as one of the gods after his death, the divinity of Heracles can be said to be of the highest class."

#: status_skills.dic:238
msgid "黄金律"
msgstr "Golden Rule"

#: status_skills.dic:240
msgid ""
"身体の黄金比ではなく、\n"
"人生において\n"
"金銭がどれほどついて回るかの宿命。\n"
"\n"
"大富豪でもやっていける金ピカぶり。\n"
"一生金には困らない。"
msgstr ""
"Not the percentage of gold in one’s body, but instead the chances of attracting gold during one’s life.\n"
"\n"
"With this level of gold, one will became an incredibly wealth person.\n"
"\n"
"Money trouble will be completely unknown."

#: status_skills.dic:249
msgid ""
"大軍団を指揮・統率する才能。\n"
"\n"
"ここまでくると\n"
"人望ではなく魔力、呪いの類である。"
msgstr ""
"Talent to command and lead a great army.\n"
"\n"
"At this level, it is not so much strength of character, but more like a curse."

#: status_skills.dic:257
msgid "Ｂ（Ａ＋）"
msgstr "B (A+)"

#: status_skills.dic:258
msgid ""
"最大の神霊適性を持つのだが、\n"
"ギルガメッシュ本人が神を嫌っているので\n"
"ランクダウンしている。"
msgstr "He has the capacity for greatness, but since Gilgamesh himself dislikes the gods, the rank is reduced."

#: status_skills.dic:265
msgid "投擲（短刀）"
msgstr "Throwing (Daggers)"

#: status_skills.dic:267
msgid "短刀を弾丸として放つ能力。"
msgstr "The ability to fire a dagger like a bullet."

#: status_skills.dic:274
msgid "風除けの加護"
msgstr "Divine Protection from the Wind"

#: status_skills.dic:276
msgid "イスラムに伝わる台風避けの呪い。"
msgstr "A curse handed down in Islam, used to ward off storms."

#: status_skills.dic:285
msgid "自己改造"
msgstr "Self Remodeling"

#: status_skills.dic:287
msgid ""
"自身の肉体に、\n"
"まったく別の肉体を付属・融合させる適性。\n"
"\n"
"このランクが上がればあがるほど\n"
"正純の英雄から遠ざかっていく。"
msgstr ""
"How well one can attach and fuse a totally different body to one’s own.\n"
"\n"
"The higher the rank, the further one is from a legitimate hero."

#: status_skills.dic:296
msgid ""
"戦闘時、\n"
"つねに自身にとって最適な展開を\n"
"“感じ取る”能力。\n"
"\n"
"常に凶暴性を抑えている為、\n"
"直感が鈍っている。"
msgstr ""
"The ability to always “feel” the best course for oneself during combat.\n"
"\n"
"Because she is continually suppressing her rage, her instincts have become more blunt."

#: status_skills.dic:305
msgid ""
"膨大な魔力は\n"
"セイバーが意識せずとも、\n"
"濃霧となって体を覆う。\n"
"\n"
"黒い甲冑と魔力の余波によって、\n"
"防御力が格段に向上している。"
msgstr ""
"An enormous amount of magical energy always covers Black Saber’s body like a dense fog.\n"
"\n"
"With her black armor and her trail of mana, her defense has increased considerably."

#: status_skills.dic:314
msgid ""
"軍団を指揮する天性の才能。\n"
"団体戦闘において、自軍の能力を向上させる。\n"
"\n"
"統率力こそ上がるものの、\n"
"兵の士気は極度に減少する。"
msgstr ""
"Talent to command and lead a great army.\n"
"\n"
"Increases the ability of one’s allies in a battle between armies.\n"
"\n"
"Her leadership is increased, but the morale of her soldiers decreases dramatically."

#: suflags_hack.ks:4
msgid "わかめパラダイス"
msgstr "Wakame Paradise"

#: suflags_hack.ks:14
msgid "二日前"
msgstr "2 days ago"

#: suflags_hack.ks:16
msgid "一日前"
msgstr "1 day ago"

#: suflags_hack.ks:18
msgid "当日"
msgstr "The day"

#: suflags_hack.ks:24
